\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. \cf0  Onward! Christian soldiers
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Marching as to war
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Christ the Royal Master
\par Leads against the foe
\par Forward into battle
\par See! His banners go
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Onward Christian soldiers
\par Marching as to war
\par With the Cross of Jesus
\par Going on before.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  2.  At the sign of triumph
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Satan's legions flee
\par On then, Christian solders
\par On to victory
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Hell's foundation quiver
\par At the shout of praise
\par Brothers, lift your voices
\par Loud your anthems raise.
\par Onward! Christian soldiers....
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Like a mighty army
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Moves the Church of God
\par Brothers, we are treading
\par \pard\li180\sl190\slmult0   Where the saints have trod
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6   Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We are not divided
\par   All one body we
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 One in hope, in doctrine
\par One in charity.
\par Onward! Christian soldiers....
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Crowns and thrones may perish
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Kingdoms rise and wane
\par But the Church of Jesus
\par Constant will remain
\par Gates of hell can never
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 'Gainst that Church prevail
\par We have Christ's own promise
\par And that cannot fail.
\par Onward! Christian soldiers....
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li315\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.  Onward, then ye people
\par \pard\li315\sl190\slmult0 Join our happy throng
\par Blend with ours your voices
\par In the triumph song
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 'Glory, laud and honour
\par Unto Christ the King
\par This, through countless ages
\par Me and angels sing.
\par Onward! Christian soldiers....
\par \pard\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

